{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/65sz29sz","slide":8,"text":"See if people would use it after work","textPreview":"See if people would use it after work","textChars":37,"textLines":1,"bbox":[929,432,178,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/761gvetk","slide":8,"text":"Our aim is simple: make recovery easier when people have the least energy to decide.","textPreview":"Our aim is simple: make recovery easier when people have the least energy to decide.","textChars":84,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,575,1000,40]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/n5dimx","slide":8,"text":"Our next step is to collect survey and interview feedback. Based on this, we will define the first version of the app, create a prototype, and test whether people would actually use it after work."}